 he shared fandom of anime and transit\, with an expanded lineup of artists
 \, performances\, food\, cosplay\, and more. Get to know BART’s anime ma
 scots at bart.gov/anime . Details What: Let’s Glow! BART Anime Festival 
 When: Saturday\, September 19\, 4pm to 9pm Where: Warm Springs/South Fremo
 nt Station RSVP on Eventbrite at letsglowfestival.eventbrite.com . Not req
 uired but helps us get a headcount. Free to attend What to expect Artist A
 lley: More than 100 artists will sell a mix of BART\, anime-\, and transit
